<title>UK: Two of Tuesday's three Brent crude cargoes kept.</title>
<headline>Two of Tuesday's three Brent crude cargoes kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of the three Brent cargoes nominated loading dates on Tuesday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline but a third was left unclaimed, traders said.</p>
<p>British Petroleum kept two September 18-20 loading Brent cargoes and Shell trading and shipping company, Stasco was clocked with the third, traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8974</p>
